  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP: Crisis Response to urgent needs in Zaporizhzhia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to support the energy sector so approx. 250.000 people of Zaporizhzhia can benefit from reliable access to energy. Gas Pistons are critical equipment which will enhance maneuvering capacity in the energy system, while also being able to operate on biogas.  The project will include procurement of activities, transportation, support for installation and training for maintenance and training of local authorities to enhance data management, analytical and planning capabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
