  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project envisages powering the city&apos;s water supply, sewage and heat supply systems. The total capacity of the necessary generating equipment is up to 50 MW. Given the dispersion of critical infrastructure facilities and topographic features (the city is located on two banks of the Dnieper, has 2 water intake stations and 2 WWTPs, for each bank separately), eight installation points are envisaged: 1 &#x2013; up to 10 MW, 2 &#x2013; up to 10 MW, 3 &#x2013; up to 6 MW, 4 &#x2013; up to 6 MW, 5 &#x2013; up to 6 MW, 6 &#x2013; up to 4 MW, 7 &#x2013; up to 4 MW, 8 &#x2013; up to 2 MW.</narrative>
   </title>
